Error [E0065]: This function uses the retired `::` body marker.
  --> tests/ui/arg_label_repeated.jet:1:79
    |
  1 | fn connect(host: String, /, *, timeout: Int = 30, tls: Bool = true) => String :: "{host}"
    |                                                                               ^^
 Why: A one-expression function body uses `:>`; `::` binds a name, and `=` fills a slot inside a definition.
 Fix: Replace `::` with `:>`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.

Error [E0765]: `timeout:` is written twice in this call to `connect`
  --> tests/ui/arg_label_repeated.jet:3:45
    |
  3 |     _ :: connect("db.internal", timeout: 5, timeout: 10)
    |                                             ^^^^^^^
 Why: each parameter takes exactly one argument
 Fix: remove one of the `timeout:` arguments
